      {
         "id": "c",
         "prompt": "Find the average acceleration of the particle over the time interval \\( 0 \\le t \\le 3 \\). Find the time \\( t \\), with \\( 0 < t < 3 \\), at which the acceleration of the particle equals this average acceleration.",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "t = \\frac{3}{2}",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Velocity at the two ends of the interval.",
               "latex": "v(0) = 36, \\quad v(3) = 54 - 90 + 36 = 0"
